      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从刚才开始，\n黄金城市一直拿衣服在我身上比划，\n完全没有自己要买的意思。",
      "source_fingerprint": "562cbf7f490353758bbd16359615a0ad0fa8501f3a48f91673988786476edfd7",
