      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她与碰巧遇到的东瀛佐敦，\n你一言我一语地不断挑着衣服。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b82e9f728476daba87bfa6a842eaf2675569945faa5ee8c5daa5f54da35a33d5",
